---
import Mark from './Mark.astro';
---

<section id="problem" class="sf-problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="sf-container sf-section-inner">
    <div class="sf-section-head" style="max-width: 820px">
      <p class="sf-label"><Mark />Why the cash flow statement seems daunting</p>
      <h2 id="problem-title" class="sf-h2">The math takes minutes. The digging takes days.</h2>
      <p class="sf-lede">
        Your cash flow template picks up the balance changes. Deciding what belongs in operating, investing or
        financing, and what isn't cash at all, means going back into the GL line by line.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="sf-problem-grid">
      <div class="sf-feature">
        <div class="sf-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 7h18M3 12h18M3 17h10"></path><circle cx="18" cy="17" r="3"></circle></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="sf-feature-body">
          <h3>Capex hiding in AP</h3>
          <p>Half of the payables may belong in investing. You can't tell which half just from the balances.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-feature">
        <div class="sf-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="sf-feature-body">
          <h3>Disposals traced by hand</h3>
          <p>No fixed asset rollforward you can trust, so every disposal gets traced through the GL by hand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-feature">
        <div class="sf-feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21c1.5-4 4.5-6 8-6s6.5 2 8 6"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="sf-feature-body">
          <h3>Prior judgment stays in someone's head</h3>
          <p>Last Q2 you decided cash sitting at Stripe isn't cash yet. Who else knows that?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
